        "children": [],
        "answer": {
          "short": "$4x-3=17$, so $x=5$.",
          "worked": "Let $x$ be the number.\n\n$$\\begin{align*}4x-3&=17\\\\4x&=20\\\\x&=\\frac{20}{4}\\\\x&=5\\end{align*}$$\n\nCheck: $4\\times5-3=17$.",
          "solutionDiagrams": []
        },
        "answerSpaceMm": 43
